<p style="margin-top:24px;font-size:16px"><strong>Cafe owners</strong> are considering <a href="https://news.example.org/REDACTED" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Cafes Weigh Price Increase" target="_blank">raising menu prices</a> next quarter, a trade group said, as bean costs climb. A regional roaster <a href="https://news.example.org/REDACTED" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Roaster Reports Record Sales" target="_blank">reported record sales</a> despite the pressure.<br><br><strong>Transit update:</strong> Planners say the new tram line <a href="https://news.example.org/REDACTED" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Tram Line Approved" target="_blank">cleared its final vote</a>.</p>
